Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:08:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(plugins): expand Linux architecture support

---
 plugins/hydra-torrent/build.py          |   4 +-
 plugins/hydra-torrent/hydra-plugin.toml |  20 +++++
 plugins/hydra-youtube/hydra-plugin.toml |  12 +--
