+welcome = """Install yt-dlp with system’s package manager and make it available on PATH. Choose an installed JavaScript runtime (Node or Deno) when YouTube requires it. Install ffmpeg on PATH to combine video and audio or extract MP3 audio. Add a YouTube video or playlist URL, then choose quality, audio and subtitles before downloading."""
